---
import AboutHeroImage from "../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg";
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Some things about me"
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hi! I'm Micael, a software engineer from Portugal with a habit of turning my
		spare time into projects. When I'm not at my day job writing code, you'll
		find me tinkering with home labs, playing with electronics, or fiddling with
		3D printers.
	</p>

	<p>
		This blog is where I share what I'm building, what I'm learning, and the
		lessons (sometimes painful) from trying to master both software and
		hardware.
	</p>

	<p>
		Hopefully you'll find something here that sparks your curiosity. Thanks for
		stopping by.
	</p>
</Layout>
